'' -cnoverify skips the layout check: the binding is what the importer wrote, a record
'' whose layout tiko does not reproduce included -- lay_member_aligned, whose member C
'' over-aligns by an attribute FreeBASIC cannot spell.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -cnoverify -cimport tests/cimport/src/layout.h -cimport-out -
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: type lay_member_aligned extern "c"
'' EXPECT-OUT: type lay_holds_aligned extern "c"
'' EXPECT-OUT: type lay_bits extern "c"
'' EXPECT-NOT: tiko lays it out
